.tl-theme__light {
**Example:** On a canvas with an arrow midpoint 10px below the top edge and a 128px-tall menu, the new menu starts at -54px. Its heading and first choice are clipped; the old menu started at 10px.

**Recommended fix:** Keep midpoint centering when space permits, but measure or otherwise constrain the dropdown's position to the visible canvas bounds. Account for both the main list and any open flyout.

</details>

